Z||000000||BAM-BAM||04-30-2001||08:14 PM||||  Just got off the phone with Gloria in Anehiem. She told me that FOCOA headers are the only true headers for the Fiero V6. The price is $550.00 uncoated, $740.00 coated. Now, I need some input from those who have or have had FOCOA headers. Are they worth the $$$?<BR>Gloria told me that any other headers out there for the V6 are one offs of theres and that theres are the only ones with true dyno sheets taken from an 86 Fiero with 86,000 miles, 25+ HP gain???. Give me the poop fellas, is this true?? She also told me that Ed Parks would validate what she said. TIA<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||12
