Z||000004||Alex4mula||05-01-2001||08:56 AM||||Well... I have them and to be honest I really don't think they add 25HP. I cannot really tell the differenec because the were added with a 3.4 swap plus many other mods. But if they add 25HP plus the 3.4 added HP my car would feel more faster. My only comparison is how it feels compared with my C5 Vette. But...  One thing I can say is that the construction, fit & finish are of very very high quality. I have the coated ones. They definitley should add HP but how much is still in debate.||||reg||1
